"text": "This look brings your autumn workday to life with a grey blazer and white linen skirt, paired with white platform sandals and a beige handbag. The gold-and-silver metal details in your jewelry echo the starfish on the sandals without adding extra weight, while the neutral palette stays clean against your office backdrop.",
"how_to_wear": [
"The structured lines of the blazer frame your shoulders and waist, drawing attention to your defined silhouette."
],
